<title>USA: Stone Container Corp posts Q1 shr loss.</title>
<headline>Stone Container Corp posts Q1 shr loss.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr primary loss	 $0.99   profit	 $0.31</p>
<p> Shr diluted		  N/A   profit	 $0.30</p>
<p> Net loss		  96,700   profit	32,400</p>
<p> Revs		   1,180,800		1,321,500</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	99,300		   99,200</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	   N/A		  104,400</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Net loss applicable to common shares was $98.7 million in 1997 versus net income of $30.4 million in 1996. Fully diluted share loss and average diluted shares outstanding for 1997 were not announced due to anti-dilutive nature, Stone Container said.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
